{"id":"465518","name":"冬瓜虾仁海米汤","author":"慕容雪薇","authorId":"10875005","desc":"","cover":"images/465518/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"冬瓜","amount":"半块"},{"name":"虾仁","amount":"200g"},{"name":"海米","amount":"一把"}],"sub":[{"name":"小葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"2个"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"2匙"},{"name":"盐","amount":"2匙"},{"name":"白胡椒粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"葱姜切好，备用。","img":"images/465518/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"虾仁去虾线，放白胡椒粉，葱花腌制5分钟。","img":"images/465518/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"冬瓜去皮，切片。","img":"images/465518/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"少量油热爆香姜片和部分葱花。","img":"images/465518/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入虾仁快速翻炒半分钟。","img":"images/465518/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入冬瓜继续翻炒1分钟，放耗油。","img":"images/465518/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加清水煮沸后撒上海米。","img":"images/465518/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"临出锅放盐和剩下的葱花即可。","img":"images/465518/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品～鲜香味美，低卡路里，美容养颜。","img":"images/465518/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}